# Cloudflare Pages response headers (pattern line, then indented `Name: Value` lines).
#
# Safe security headers only. We deliberately do NOT set:
#   - Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy (COEP): `require-corp` would break loading the
#     cross-origin R2 bundle from https://lists.aml-filter.com. The app does not
#     need cross-origin isolation.
#   - Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy (COOP): unnecessary and pairs with COEP.
#   - Content-Security-Policy (CSP): the app loads WASM, spawns web/module workers,
#     and fetches the R2 bundle; a wrong CSP silently breaks the screen. Left as a
#     browser-validated follow-up (see docs/DEPLOY.md).
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
